# Single-source normalize

When running or editing `scripts/normalize.mjs`:

- Default `pnpm normalize` uses `--source host`.
- Use `--source all` only when you need cross-source coverage; dedup always runs per `session_id` (prefers host, workspace-scoped paths, newer mtime).
- Prefer `host` over `all` on duplicated host+devcontainer trees to avoid scanning duplicate trees.

Subagent files must pass through `parent_session_id` on each turn when `raw_path` contains `/subagents/`.
